                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]Pros[/h1]\r\n[list]\r\n    [*]Collaboration game that takes place after the events of Lost Song where Accel World's Brain Burst universe (20 years into the future) merges into Svart Alfheim\r\n    [*]Many scenes and interactions between all the characters; all voiced by the original Seiyuu's\r\n    [*]Just about a 1:1 copy of Lost Song's systems (combat, skills, leveling, gearing, animations) with an endgame dungeon similar to Hollow Realization's (1000 floors)\r\n    [*]Short but interesting story centered around Yui and immortality\r\n    [*][b]Yuna (Ordinal Scale Mentioned)[/b]\r\n[/list]\r\n[h1]Cons[/h1]\r\n[list]\r\n    [*]Besides Accel World content, gameplay is essentially \"Lost Song part 2\"\r\n    [*]Only recommend for fans or consumers of previous SAO & AW anime content\r\n    [*]Only single-player SAO game that is non-canon to the game series (not a con but worth mentioning)\r\n[/list]",
